---
// Hero section with split screen layout
---

<section class="min-h-[85vh] bg-background">
    <div
        class="mx-auto grid min-h-[85vh] max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 px-6 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:px-8 lg:py-24"
    >
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center space-y-8 lg:pr-8">
            <div class="space-y-7">
                <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase text-primary" style="letter-spacing: 0.18em;">
                    Strategy. Analytics. AI Governance.
                </p>

                <h1
                    class="font-semibold text-neutral-900"
                    style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2.5vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em;"
                >
                    Chief Strategy and Analytics Officer. I run strategy, build the analytics, and write the AI governance — for an organization that moved first-gen graduation from 25% to 75%+.
                </h1>

                <p
                    class="max-w-2xl text-neutral-700"
                    style="font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1rem + 0.4vw, 1.375rem); line-height: 1.55;"
                >
                    Strategy that's tested. Analytics that's reproducible. AI that's governed. At DC CAP, partner graduation runs 75–95% against a 20–25% national baseline for first-generation, low-income college students.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-4">
                <a
                    href="/projects"
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-neutral-900 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:bg-neutral-800 hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-neutral-900 focus:ring-offset-2"
                >
                    View Selected Work
                </a>
                <a
                    href="/consulting"
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border-2 border-neutral-200 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 transition-colors hover:border-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-900 hover:text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-neutral-900 focus:ring-offset-2"
                >
                    Work With Me
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center lg:order-last">
            <div
                class="relative h-[400px] w-full max-w-md overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-neutral-100 shadow-2xl sm:h-[500px] lg:h-[600px]"
            >
                <img
                    src="/Preston1.jpg"
                    alt="Preston Magouirk"
                    class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-all duration-700 hover:scale-105"
                    loading="eager"
                />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

